  "applies_to": "Airflow Entro-V MVHR units with the Entro-V control board (Basic controller 90001308 / Digital controller 90001299), per controls manual 80001022 Issue 1 (08/20).",
  "summary": "The Entro-V is a heat recovery ventilation unit whose control board acts as a Modbus RTU slave on RS-485. Only function 03 (read) and 06 (write single) are supported and every point is a single 16-bit register. The map covers on/off, fan speed stages and mode, temperatures and sensor values, output and input states, the set point and the alarm code.",
